<span class="badge badge-pending">Pending Confirmation</span>

<h2>Reservation Created</h2>

<p>Hello <strong>{{customerName}}</strong>,</p>

<p>Your parking reservation has been created and is currently awaiting payment confirmation. Your spot is temporarily reserved.</p>

<div class="alert-box alert-warning">
  <strong>Hold Window Active:</strong> Your reservation is held for <strong>10 minutes</strong>. Please complete payment within this window to secure your parking spot.
</div>

<table class="details-table">
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Booking Reference</td>
    <td class="value">{{bookingReference}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Parking Facility</td>
    <td class="value">{{facilityName}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Booking Date</td>
    <td class="value">{{bookingDate}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Start Time</td>
    <td class="value">{{startTime}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="label">End Time</td>
    <td class="value">{{endTime}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{#if message}}
  <tr>
    <td class="label">Additional Notes</td>
    <td class="value">{{message}}</td>
  </tr>
  {{/if}}
</table>

<p>Once your payment is confirmed, you will receive an official confirmation receipt along with parking navigation details.</p>
